.twicerun/
# The eval's trial directories and the amplification-gap script's passes. Both
# are removed on the way out, but only on the success path, so a Ctrl-C six
# minutes into a run used to leave up to 1,292 MB of TLC-derived Parquet
# stageable in a repository that commits no data bytes.
.twicerun-eval/
.twicerun-gap/

# NYC TLC trip records. Fetched by scripts/fetch_tlc.py, never committed:
# TLC publishes no licence for them, only a disclaimer that it did not create
# the data, so the repository carries the checksums and the address instead.
data/
